/E (Equinox fitness, founded in 1991, caters to the wealthy audience while offering a unique blend of digital and physical offerings. Originally founded in New York by the Errico family, Equinox quickly grew to be the premier destination for self- improvement and now has over 100 locations around the world. With an annual revenue of 8.2 billion in 2022 and the ongoing expansion east, Bangalore offers a unique and extremely plausible location to franchise in. With a growing population of millionaires, closing in on 10,000, and an average age of 28, Bangalore will provide the perfect foothold into South Asia for this exclusive gym.)
