/Title (The Bangalore Equinox location will be co owned by three individuals. Jason Fletcher, Aarnav Gupta and Ronan Arvind will each own 33.33% of the company and will co run the company. Each member will be assigned a different role. Ronan will be Director of Marketing due to their charismatic personality, Aarnav will be Director of Operations due to his outstanding decision making skills and impeccable judgement on personnel matters. Jason will be the Director of Finance due to his in depth knowledge of the field and his extreme passion for numbers and statistics.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1008 0 R
/Prev 1018 0 R
/Next 1028 0 R
>>
