1025 0 obj
<<
/Title (Talent from all over the nation and the world has been drawn there by its pleasant climate and high standard of living, which has sparked a thriving entrepreneurial culture. Recent improvements to the city's connectivity and infrastructure make it a prime location for companies in a variety of industries, including manufacturing, finance, biotechnology, and information technology. Bangalore remains a top choice for businesses hoping to prosper in India's quickly changing economic landscape because of its cosmopolitan charm and proactive government that promotes business growth.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1021 0 R
>>
